repository-code: "https://github.com/wilhelm-lab/dlomix"
url: "https://github.com/wilhelm-lab/dlomix"
abstract: >-
  DLOmix is a Python framework for deep learning in proteomics with
  multi-backend support for both TensorFlow/Keras (Keras 3) and PyTorch,
  exposing identical APIs across backends. It provides datasets, models,
  losses, and evaluation utilities for tasks such as retention time,
  fragment-ion intensity, charge-state, detectability, and ion-mobility
  prediction.
keywords:
  - proteomics
  - deep learning
  - mass spectrometry
  - tensorflow
  - keras
  - pytorch
